{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39203","headline":"陪金陵府相中堂夜宴 · 韦庄","name":"陪金陵府相中堂夜宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满耳笙歌满眼花，满楼珠翠胜吴娃。\n因知海上神仙窟，只似人间富贵家。\n绣户夜攒红烛市，舞衣晴曳碧天霞。\n却愁宴罢青蛾散，杨子江头月半斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}